      "order": 0,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "1 RESOLUTION NO. 9813"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 1,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 2,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "3 A RESOLUTION introduced by Public Infrastructure Committee recommending"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 3,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "4 approval of Project Nos. 841099.11, 501125.02 and 281300.12 for"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 4,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "street and utility improvements on SE 37th Street from Adams Street"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 5,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "to east of Indiana Avenue"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 6,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Governing Body adopted Resolution No. 9723 approving the"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "2026-2035 Capital Improvement Program (CIP) and the 2026-2028 Capital Improvement"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Budget (CIB); and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 9,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Resolution requires Governing Body approval for projects that are"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 10,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "ready for construction and whose total project budget exceeds $250,000; and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 11,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on May 19, 2026, the Public Infrastructure Committee recommended"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 12,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "approval of the project."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 13,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED, BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 14,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "CITY OF TOPEKA, KANSAS, that Project Nos. 841099.11, 501125.02 and 281300.12"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 15,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "for street and utility improvements on SE 37th Street from Adams Street to east of Indiana"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 16,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Avenue as further described in Exhibit A is hereby approved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 17,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "ADOPTED and APPROVED by the Governing Body on June 2, 2026."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 18,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "20"
    },
